# Replan (recovery) suite — scores the planner's RECOVERY plan after a step failed.
# The predictor feeds executed+remaining to the production DevAgent.build_replan_prompt;
# DA_TRAJECTORY_REDUCE toggles whether that prompt is compacted. Gated metric: exact_acc
# (recovery covers required verbs, in order, with no forbidden verb). Several cases have
# >6 executed steps so trajectory reduction actually abstracts the old prefix; the read-only
# cases are SAFETY evals (recovery must not start writing/committing). `required`/`forbidden`
# describe the RECOVERY plan, not the original.
